    "title": "みんなに祝福を",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "はっ……はっ……はっ……はっ……！",
            "enText": "<i>Pant, pant…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": -8174524791283996535
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 105,
                    "pathId": -2883535613810467725
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3053432276409122833,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "走っても走っても、勝つことができない。\nそれでもライスシャワーは諦めることなく、トレーニングを続けた。",
            "enText": "No matter how hard she runs, Rice can't seem to find a win. Still, she \nhasn't given up on training.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": -6343149501440213599
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 193,
                    "pathId": 3480931886592738579
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2418740821268951898,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシップ",
            "enName": "Gold Ship",
            "jpText": "ホントにすげーな、ライスのヤツ。\n負けてもこうして必死に走り続けるんだからよ。",
            "enText": "Gotta give credit to Rice. Takes a whole lotta something to keep \nrunning her heart out after all those losses.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 199,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 71,
                    "pathId": -7929373442152270052
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6525855195693801627
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5832309197642866186,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "それだけに、なんとか勝たせてあげたいんだけど……。",
            "enText": "Makes you wish we could get her a win somehow…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 77,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 116,
                    "pathId": -406484632544656444
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4019878847260023862,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "お邪魔しますわ。",
            "enText": "Pardon the intrusion.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 47,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 164,
                    "pathId": -9159786576123513480
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 54,
                    "pathId": -4501629125212286304
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": 3137744231071538655
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8953034228021065125,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "えっ、マックイーン！？",
            "enText": "Wait, McQueen?!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 64,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": 915853470216254740
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 26,
                    "pathId": -3244671897417333036
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": -818830603361814456
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7545002671394872097,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "唐突とはこのことだ。チームを抜けてから久々に、\r\nメジロマックイーンがトレーニングに訪れた。",
            "enText": "Out of the blue, McQueen shows up to practice. It feels like it's been \nforever since she left the team.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": 3807596185027678383
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 61,
                    "pathId": 7536437462537909036
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": 1074951481141430200
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 2187830524462602831
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1952824028387187765,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "ライスさん、この前のレースでも振るわなかったようですが、\r\n調子はどうです？",
            "enText": "I saw Rice didn't do so well in her last race. How's she doing now?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 190,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 239,
                    "pathId": -9069577237459062755
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3303677005599880865
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 85,
                    "pathId": -1396860048452196130
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": 6000293009879721078
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4138955987293811593,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "レースに対する気持ちは充分にあるし、トレーニングもしっかり\nこなしてるんだけど、なぜか結果が出せないんだ。",
            "enText": "She's still got the drive, and she's training like always, but for some \nreason she just can't deliver.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 202,
                    "pathId": 6725493001770859569
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 185,
                    "pathId": 511585501780600944
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": 1376870767940851334
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6221898358999549848,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "レースに対する気持ちは充分にあるし、トレーニングもしっかり\r\nこなしてるんだけど、なぜか結果が出せなくて。",
            "enText": "She's still got the drive, and she's training like always, but for some \nreason she just can't deliver.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 202,
                    "pathId": -2179420197815317304
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 169,
                    "pathId": -8701820996956239613
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": -5646180059791838939
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6186529078070046584,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "<username>",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ミホノブルボンやマックイーンと走った時のような\nあの気迫が無いと言うか……。",
            "enText": "She's just… missing something. That something she had when she \nraced you and Bourbon.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 94,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 202,
                    "pathId": -4254019789550638371
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 130,
                    "pathId": 4345432860189515706
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": -4163017816348696762
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1077411908803769616,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "……なるほど。",
            "enText": "…I see.",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 47,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 202,
                    "pathId": 1613573618480423654
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 85,
                    "pathId": -695068459739221401
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": -4832686425384562898
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8341380705165189489,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "今のライスさんは、追いかけるべき背中を\r\n見つけられていないのかもしれません。",
            "enText": "Perhaps she's lost sight of a target to chase.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 190,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 202,
                    "pathId": 5195076561431631522
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 133,
                    "pathId": -2186994000110297305
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 155,
                    "pathId": -6496786110180165187
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 1147009112648424542
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4777114844495604830,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "でも逆に言えば、目標をしっかりと示すことで\r\n以前のように走れる可能性があるということですわ。",
            "enText": "Which means that if you're able to give her a new target, she may run \nlike she once did.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 252,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 332,
                    "pathId": -7865770849639994717
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -2292331135430922142
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 109,
                    "pathId": -3285573874852250006
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 151,
                    "pathId": 1880125586427499290
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 373599270019231255,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "ということで……さっそく着替えてきますわね。",
            "enText": "In other words… I'd best hurry and get changed.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "えっ、マックイーンも走るの？",
                    "enText": "Wait, what? You're going to run?",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 332,
                    "pathId": 6321173851022779449
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": 7794110184668090723
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": -8759636358980894824
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5409496118890364426,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "私は今日、その為に来たのですわ。",
            "enText": "Why else do you think I've come here?",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 332,
                    "pathId": 4690830776902706322
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 109,
                    "pathId": -7902510102641525798
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 394674273355706264
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8775938972194783699,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "まだこちらの用が終わりきったわけではありませんが、\nいくらか時間を作れるようになりましたので。",
            "enText": "I still have some unfinished business, but I have a bit more free time \nthan before.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 203,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 332,
                    "pathId": -5192278070394536780
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 233,
                    "pathId": 3381866280219532880
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -2599789903471678527
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2382300177135094946,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "それに、これ以上チームの皆さんと走るのを\n我慢しきれませんわ。",
            "enText": "Besides, I don't think I can wait any longer to run with the team again.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 160,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 332,
                    "pathId": 7615100831355119089
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": 1440715603751674566
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 27,
                    "pathId": 7249623693225881940
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6824980570866620016,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "――とその前に、1つお願いを聞いていただきたいのですが……。",
            "enText": "Oh, but before that, I have a favor to ask you.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 190,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 332,
                    "pathId": -4587858012039790332
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 195,
                    "pathId": 8944459855177914562
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 182,
                    "pathId": -5602346102799380170
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2230316292922162651,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "マックイーンさんっ！？　それに……っ！！",
            "enText": "McQueen?! And…",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 86,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 179,
                    "pathId": 6438525310462823387
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
