            "pathId": 5092859178953953208,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ミホノブルボン",
            "enName": "Mihono Bourbon",
            "jpText": "力になって欲しいと、突然呼ばれました。",
            "enText": "I received a sudden invite to come help out.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 110,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 213,
                    "pathId": 6716792142624203922
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 149,
                    "pathId": -196174379634103408
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 82,
                    "pathId": 7936361902333572473
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 152,
                    "pathId": 3061782259689817347
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 4725730644916658372
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1394866142727293258,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ミホノブルボンも一緒に走る――\nそれがメジロマックイーンからのお願いだった。",
            "enText": "McQueen's \"favor\" was for me to call Mihono Bourbon over.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 94,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 213,
                    "pathId": 1103001266286046982
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 149,
                    "pathId": -3835387186218923596
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 144,
                    "pathId": -4526746034439398001
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 152,
                    "pathId": 2556954300087058662
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 132,
                    "pathId": -5909851020509672048
                }
