        {
            "jpName": "実況",
            "enName": "Commentator",
            "jpText": "ライスシャワー！　ライスシャワーがいきました！\n一気に押し上げて先頭に立った！",
            "enText": "Here's Rice Shower! She makes her move! She's pushed up into the \nlead!",
            "nextBlock": 47,
