            "voiceIdx": 32,
            "pathId": 2806656905241163946,
            "blockIdx": 46
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "勝ちたいと言う想いが消えそうになっても、\n彼女は諦めずに走り続けた。",
            "enText": "Even when her will to win seemed faint, she refused to give up, and \njust kept running.",
            "nextBlock": 48,
            "origClipLength": 89,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 2845066799948582771,
            "blockIdx": 47
        },
        {
            "jpName": "実況",
            "enName": "Commentator",
            "jpText": "ライスシャワー、先頭を譲らない！　意地でも譲らない！\nそして今……ゴール！",
            "enText": "Rice Shower isn't giving up the lead! She's desperately holding on! \nAnd now… she's done it!",
            "nextBlock": 49,
            "origClipLength": 242,
            "voiceIdx": 33,
            "pathId": -2951365335100619203,
            "blockIdx": 48
        },
        {
            "jpName": "実況",
            "enName": "Commentator",
            "jpText": "ライスシャワー、再び春の『天皇賞』を制しましたっ！！",
            "enText": "Rice Shower returns to the winner's circle in the spring Tenno Sho!",
            "nextBlock": 50,
            "origClipLength": 169,
            "voiceIdx": 34,
            "pathId": -5855423890561870564,
            "blockIdx": 49
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そして、その想いは人から人へと伝わり――",
            "enText": "And I'm not the only one who's taken notice.",
            "nextBlock": 51,
            "origClipLength": 71,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -6255021584753072512,
            "blockIdx": 50
        },
        {
            "jpName": "観客A",
            "enName": "Spectator A",
            "jpText": "……いろんな偉業を阻んでおきながら\n何度も何度も負け続けて、ようやく勝ちかよ。",
            "enText": "After denying so many records, and losing so many times, she finally \nwins, huh.",
            "nextBlock": 52,
            "origClipLength": 247,
            "voiceIdx": 35,
            "pathId": -5894003669126949613,
            "blockIdx": 51
        },
        {
            "jpName": "観客A",
            "enName": "Spectator A",
            "jpText": "ったく、待たせすぎだぞーっ！！！！\nライス、おめでとぉーっ！！！！",
            "enText": "How long were you gonna make us wait?! Congrats, Rice!",
            "nextBlock": 53,
            "origClipLength": 154,
            "voiceIdx": 36,
            "pathId": 6315808076348342612,
            "blockIdx": 52
        },
        {
            "jpName": "観客B",
            "enName": "Spectator B",
            "jpText": "よく頑張った！　すごいぞーっ！！",
            "enText": "Good job! You were great!",
