            "voiceIdx": 40,
            "pathId": 4438627693424657241,
            "blockIdx": 57
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "どんなに辛い思いをしても、どんなに負け続けても、\n諦めずに挑み続ける。",
            "enText": "When the whole world seemed to be dragging her down, she crawled \nback up, one step at a time.",
            "nextBlock": 59,
            "origClipLength": 90,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -6151327300980504095,
            "blockIdx": 58
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そんな努力が実を結んだとき、\n彼女は誰からも祝福され、愛されるウマ娘になった。",
            "enText": "She held on. Worked harder than ever. And now, she's rewarded with \nlove from all.",
            "nextBlock": 60,
            "origClipLength": 95,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -5969977115872744944,
            "blockIdx": 59
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "……みんな、ありがとう！！",
            "enText": "…Thank you, everyone!",
            "nextBlock": 61,
            "origClipLength": 84,
            "voiceIdx": 41,
            "pathId": 7929000335469782010,
            "blockIdx": 60
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "ライスは、どこまでも走り続けます……！\r\n走り続けて、みんなに笑顔になってもらいますっ！！",
